; Regolfo
; This file connects (via overland survey in 2414-15-01) caves: 2414, 2976, 2977, 5461 and defines entrance to 5462
; so only 2414 needs to be '*INCLUDE 2414' to attach all of these caves to a higher level survex model 
*BEGIN 2414

*INCLUDE 2414-25-01
*INCLUDE ../2976/2976
*INCLUDE ../2977/2977
*INCLUDE ../5461/5461

  *CS UTM30N
  *CS OUT UTM30N
  *DECLINATION AUTO 452374 4801074 272 
  *FIX GPS		    452374 4801074 272 

  *EQUATE	GPS  			2414-25-01.12

  *EQUATE 	2414-ent 		2414-25-01.1
  *ENTRANCE 2414-ent

  *EQUATE	5462-ent 		2414-25-01.30
  *ENTRANCE 5462-ent

  *EQUATE	2414-25-01.15	2977.15	 	
  *EQUATE	2414-25-01.19	2976.19 	
  *EQUATE	2414-25-01.21	5461.21 	

*END 2414
